flowchart TD
    A[Onboard or resume verified facts] --> B[1 Prime the goal]
    B --> C[2 Inspect authorized sources]
    C --> D[3 Decompose transformation]
    D --> E[4 Create Mermaid workflow]
    E --> F[5 Write deterministic Python and evaluation plan]
    F --> G{Execution explicitly approved?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Run reviewed synthetic tests in isolation]
    G -->|No| I[Record tests not run]
    H --> J[6 Package domain workflow as a skill]
    I --> J
    J --> K[Validate package and privacy boundaries]
    K --> L[Handoff skill ZIP, evidence, brand and open approvals]
    L --> M{Install or publish separately approved?}
    M -->|No| N[Stop at handoff]
    M -->|Yes| O[Use approved host or registry procedure]
    classDef branded fill:#EEF2FF,stroke:#1E3A8A,color:#0F172A;
    class A,B,C,D,E,F,J,K,L branded;
